### GET books by authorId
GET {{facade-url}}/v1/book/author/{{authorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user-jwt}}

### GET book by ID
GET {{facade-url}}/v1/book/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user-jwt}}

### create book
POST {{facade-url}}/v1/book/
Authorization: Bearer {{user-jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "isbn": "",
  "authorId": "",
  "type": ""
}